  "? reread current configs, scripts, and release surfaces before adding more measurements",
  "< ship one repeatable experiment or output form at a time",
  "$ record what became faster, clearer, or more discussable",
  "^ project surviving results into docs, .spw, or release QA rather than leaving them in logs",
  "% keep one stable baseline while experimenting with versions or settings",
 ]
